Each function has a built-in address in the form `<FUNCTION_ID>@<PROJECT_ID>.appwrite.email`, and it does not need DNS records. To give the same function more than one address, add a name and a `+` before the function ID: `support+<FUNCTION_ID>@<PROJECT_ID>.appwrite.email` and `billing+<FUNCTION_ID>@<PROJECT_ID>.appwrite.email` both execute the same function, and the function can read which address received the email.

